istio-csr tracks the main branch, whose go.mod now declares go 1.25.0, but the
Containerfile still pins go-toolset:1.24. build_containers fails on it today,
independently of the operator version:

  go: ../go.mod requires go >= 1.25.0 (running go 1.24.6; GOTOOLCHAIN=local)

1.26 matches the other three cert-manager Containerfiles.
